# Stick Note is one self-contained program: a statically linked, position-independent file with the Rust standard
# library and a few crates inside (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt), so that the same file runs on every distribution,
# whatever its C library. Lintian takes such a file for a shared library that forgot to name what it needs.
stick-note: shared-library-lacks-prerequisites [usr/lib/stick-note/stick-note]
stick-note: statically-linked-binary [usr/lib/stick-note/stick-note]
